"current_screen, template_redirect und Klicks über POST /wm-sentinel/v1/"
"telemetry (Info); rest_pre_dispatch für /wp/v2/plugins und anonyme Abfragen "
"von /wp/v2/users (Warning)"
msgstr ""
"current_screen, template_redirect e clic tramite POST /wm-sentinel/v1/"
"telemetry (Info); rest_pre_dispatch per /wp/v2/plugins e richieste anonime "
"a /wp/v2/users (Warning)"

